```

### Supporting helper (used by BuildOwner + CheckOwnerTelephoneUnique)
**`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/function/owner/TelephoneNormalizer.java`** (package-private final class) — canonicalizes telephones to E.164. Key behavior: strips spaces/dashes/brackets; keeps a leading `+` with its country code, otherwise assumes `+61` (Australia) and drops a single leading `0`; result must be 8–15 digits after `+` or it throws `InvalidTelephoneException`. `normalize()` stores the canonical form; `comparisonKey()` is the lenient dedup key. Example: `0412 345 678` -> `+61412345678`.

### Mapper (referenced by BuildOwner and RespondWithOwnerCreated)
**`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** — MapStruct interface. `toOwner(OwnerFieldsDto)` ignores `id` and `pets`; `toOwnerDto(Owner)` adds computed `displayName` (`"Last, First"`) and `initials` (`"F.L."`).

---

## 3. Owner entity

**`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/model/Owner.java`** — `@Entity @Table(name="owners")`, extends `Person`. Fields:
- `address` — `@Column(name="address") @NotEmpty String`
- `city` — `@NotEmpty String`
- `telephone` — `@NotEmpty @Pattern(regexp = "^\\+[0-9]{8,15}$", ...)` (E.164 form)
- `email` — `String` (nullable)
- `registrationDate` — `java.time.LocalDate` (`@Column(name="registration_date")`)
- `customerCode` — `String` (`@Column(name="customer_code")`)
- `pets` — `@OneToMany(...) Set<Pet>` (exposed sorted/read-only via `getPets()`)

**`lastName` and `firstName`** are inherited from `Person`:
**`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/model/Person.java`** — `@MappedSuperclass extends BaseEntity`; `firstName` and `lastName` are `@Column @NotEmpty protected String` with standard getters/setters. `BaseEntity` supplies `id`/`isNew()`.

---

## 4. DTO classes — GENERATED, not `OwnerRequest`/`OwnerResponse`

There are **no** `OwnerRequest`/`OwnerResponse` classes. The pipeline uses **`OwnerFieldsDto`** (request body) and **`OwnerDto`** (response). These are **generated at build time** by the `openapi-generator-maven-plugin` (v7.23.0) from `openapi.yml` into `target/generated-sources/openapi/src/main/java`, package `org.springframework.samples.petclinic.rest.dto`. They do not exist as source files (the `target/` dir is not yet built).

Their shape is defined in **`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/resources/openapi.yml`**:

`OwnerFields` schema (line 1991) — becomes `OwnerFieldsDto`:
- `firstName` (string, 1–30, pattern letters/space/`'`/`-`, up to 3 words)
- `lastName` (string, 1–30, similar pattern, optional trailing `.`)
- `address` (string, 1–255)
- `city` (string, 1–80)
- `telephone` (string, 1–20)
- `email` (string, ≤255, optional)
- `registrationDate` (string, format date, optional)
- **required:** firstName, lastName, address, city, telephone

`Owner` schema (line 2057) — becomes `OwnerDto` — `allOf` OwnerFields plus read-only: `id` (int32), `displayName`, `initials`, `customerCode` (`<LAST3>-<NNNN>`), `pets` (array of Pet; required). There is also an `OwnerPage`/`OwnerPageDto` used by list endpoints.

---

## 5. OwnerRepository interface

**`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/repository/OwnerRepository.java`**
```java
package org.springframework.samples.petclinic.repository;

import java.util.Collection;

import org.springframework.dao.DataAccessException;
import org.springframework.data.domain.Page;
import org.springframework.data.domain.Pageable;
import org.springframework.samples.petclinic.model.BaseEntity;
import org.springframework.samples.petclinic.model.Owner;

public interface OwnerRepository {

    Collection<Owner> findByLastName(String lastName) throws DataAccessException;

    Page<Owner> findByLastName(String lastName, Pageable pageable) throws DataAccessException;

    Owner findById(int id) throws DataAccessException;

    void save(Owner owner) throws DataAccessException;

    Collection<Owner> findAll() throws DataAccessException;

    Page<Owner> findAll(Pageable pageable) throws DataAccessException;

